        { question: "9. ________ (he/drive) fast when the accident happened? [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "Was he driving", explanation: "CÃ¢u há»i QKTD kiá»ƒm tra tráº¡ng thÃ¡i lÃºc xáº£y ra tai náº¡n." },
        { question: "10. I didn't answer the phone because I (take) ________ a shower. [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "was taking", explanation: "ÄÆ°a ra lÃ½ do cho viá»‡c khÃ´ng nghe mÃ¡y trong quÃ¡ khá»©." },
        // Trung bÃ¬nh (11-20)
        { question: "11. While I (study) ________, my brother was playing video games. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "was studying", explanation: "Hai hÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng diá»…n ra song song (While)." },
        { question: "12. They (always/argue) ________ about money when they were young. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "were always arguing", explanation: "PhÃ n nÃ n vá» thÃ³i quen láº·p láº¡i trong quÃ¡ khá»© vá»›i 'always'." },
        { question: "13. I (wonder) ________ if you could help me with this project. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "was wondering", explanation: "DÃ¹ng QKTD vá»›i 'wonder' Ä‘á»ƒ Ä‘Æ°a ra lá»i nhá» váº£ lá»‹ch sá»± á»Ÿ hiá»‡n táº¡i." },
        { question: "14. Everyone (wait) ________ nervously for the final results to be announced. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "was waiting", explanation: "MÃ´ táº£ tráº¡ng thÃ¡i há»“i há»™p kÃ©o dÃ i." },
        { question: "15. The mechanic (repair) ________ my car the whole morning yesterday. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "was repairing", explanation: "Nháº¥n máº¡nh quÃ¡ trÃ¬nh kÃ©o dÃ i suá»‘t buá»•i sÃ¡ng (the whole morning)." },
        { question: "16. As she (read) ________ the letter, tears rolled down her cheeks. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "was reading", explanation: "'As' (trong khi) ná»‘i hÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng Ä‘ang diá»…n ra vÃ  hÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng Ä‘á»™t ngá»™t." },
        { question: "17. We didn't realize that the roof (leak) ________. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "was leaking", explanation: "Nháº­n ra má»™t sá»± viá»‡c Ä‘ang diá»…n ra ngáº§m lÃºc Ä‘Ã³." },
        { question: "18. Who ________ (you/talk) to on the phone when I walked in? [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "were you talking", explanation: "Há»i Ä‘á»‘i tÆ°á»£ng cá»§a hÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng Ä‘ang diá»…n ra." },
        { question: "19. The dogs (bark) ________ all night, so I couldn't sleep. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "were barking", explanation: "HÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng kÃ©o dÃ i 'all night' gÃ¢y háº­u quáº£." },
        { question: "20. She (prepare) ________ for the presentation when her laptop crashed. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "was preparing", explanation: "Äang chuáº©n bá»‹ thÃ¬ mÃ¡y há»ng." },
        // NÃ¢ng cao - TOEIC/IELTS (21-30)
        { question: "21. The audit team (review) ________ the financial statements when the discrepancy was found. [TOEIC]", answer: "was reviewing", explanation: "NhÃ³m kiá»ƒm toÃ¡n Ä‘ang xem xÃ©t tÃ i liá»‡u thÃ¬ phÃ¡t hiá»‡n sai sÃ³t." },
        { question: "22. While inflation (steadily/rise) ________, central banks hesitated to raise interest rates. [IELTS]", answer: "was steadily rising", explanation: "MÃ´ táº£ xu hÆ°á»›ng kinh táº¿ Ä‘ang diá»…n ra song song vá»›i thÃ¡i Ä‘á»™ cá»§a ngÃ¢n hÃ ng." },
