        { question: "10. What ________ (you/do) if you win the lottery? [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "will you do", explanation: "Váº¿ chÃ­nh cá»§a cÃ¢u Ä‘iá»u kiá»‡n loáº¡i 1." },
