        { question: "15. You look tired. I (make) ________ you a cup of tea. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "will make", explanation: "HÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng Ä‘á» nghá»‹ chÄƒm sÃ³c náº£y sinh ngay lÃºc nÃ³i." },
        { question: "16. In 2050, people (live) ________ on Mars. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "will live", explanation: "Dá»± Ä‘oÃ¡n xa xÃ´i vá» tÆ°Æ¡ng lai." },
