        { question: "24. These measures (help) ________ mitigate the effects of climate change. [IELTS]", answer: "will help", explanation: "Dá»± Ä‘oÃ¡n káº¿t quáº£ cá»§a má»™t chÃ­nh sÃ¡ch." },
