        { question: "3. We (not/be) ________ to Paris yet. [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "have not been / haven't been", explanation: "Dáº¥u hiá»‡u 'yet' trong cÃ¢u phá»§ Ä‘á»‹nh HTHT." },
