        { question: "5. He (live) ________ here since 2010. [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "has lived", explanation: "Dáº¥u hiá»‡u 'since' + má»‘c thá»i gian." },
        { question: "6. I (know) ________ him for 5 years. [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "have known", explanation: "Dáº¥u hiá»‡u 'for' + khoáº£ng thá»i gian." },
        { question: "7. My parents (buy) ________ a new house recently. [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "have bought", explanation: "Dáº¥u hiá»‡u 'recently' (gáº§n Ä‘Ã¢y)." },
        { question: "8. The train (not/arrive) ________ yet. [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "has not arrived / hasn't arrived", explanation: "ChÆ°a tá»›i tÃ­nh Ä‘áº¿n hiá»‡n táº¡i (yet)." },
        { question: "9. I (lose) ________ my keys, I can't get into the house. [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "have lost", explanation: "HÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng máº¥t chÃ¬a khÃ³a gÃ¢y háº­u quáº£ á»Ÿ hiá»‡n táº¡i (khÃ´ng vÃ o Ä‘Æ°á»£c nhÃ )." },
        { question: "10. How long ________ (you/work) at this company? [CÆ¡ báº£n]", answer: "have you worked", explanation: "Há»i khoáº£ng thá»i gian kÃ©o dÃ i tá»« QK Ä‘áº¿n hiá»‡n táº¡i." },
        // Trung bÃ¬nh (11-20)
        { question: "11. This is the best book I (ever/read) ________. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "have ever read", explanation: "Cáº¥u trÃºc sau so sÃ¡nh nháº¥t luÃ´n dÃ¹ng HTHT." },
        { question: "12. So far, we (complete) ________ half of the project. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "have completed", explanation: "Dáº¥u hiá»‡u 'So far' (cho Ä‘áº¿n nay)." },
        { question: "13. The weather (be) ________ terrible all week. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "has been", explanation: "Thá»i tiáº¿t tá»‡ kÃ©o dÃ i suá»‘t tuáº§n cho tá»›i hiá»‡n táº¡i." },
        { question: "14. She (never/meet) ________ such a rude person. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "has never met", explanation: "Tráº£i nghiá»‡m 'chÆ°a bao giá»' trong Ä‘á»i." },
        { question: "15. Over the past few months, prices (increase) ________ significantly. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "have increased", explanation: "Dáº¥u hiá»‡u 'Over the past few months'." },
        { question: "16. I (write) ________ three essays this morning. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "have written", explanation: "HÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng láº·p láº¡i nhiá»u láº§n trong khoáº£ng thá»i gian chÆ°a káº¿t thÃºc (this morning)." },
        { question: "17. The government (make) ________ several changes to the tax law lately. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "has made", explanation: "Dáº¥u hiá»‡u 'lately' (gáº§n Ä‘Ã¢y)." },
        { question: "18. He is the most intelligent student I (teach) ________. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "have taught", explanation: "Theo sau so sÃ¡nh nháº¥t." },
        { question: "19. Up to now, they (not/respond) ________ to my email. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "have not responded / haven't responded", explanation: "Dáº¥u hiá»‡u 'Up to now' (cho Ä‘áº¿n nay)." },
        { question: "20. My computer (crash) ________ twice today. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", answer: "has crashed", explanation: "Sá»‘ láº§n láº·p láº¡i trong má»™t ngÃ y chÆ°a káº¿t thÃºc." },
        // NÃ¢ng cao - TOEIC/IELTS (21-30)
        { question: "21. Our company (recently/acquire) ________ a promising tech startup. [TOEIC]", answer: "has recently acquired", explanation: "CÃ´ng ty vá»«a thÃ¢u tÃ³m/mua láº¡i má»™t startup (recently)." },
