        { q: "29. It is (extreme) _____ cold today. [Trung bÃ¬nh]", a: "extremely", e: "Bá»• nghÄ©a cho tÃ­nh tá»« 'cold' cáº§n má»™t Tráº¡ng tá»« -> extremely." },
