        // --- LEVEL 3: NÃ‚NG CAO (TOEIC/IELTS) (41-60) ---
        { q: "41. The board of directors has (approve) _____ the new budget. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "approved", e: "Sau trá»£ Ä‘á»™ng tá»« 'has' cáº§n Äá»™ng tá»« á»Ÿ dáº¡ng V3/ed (ThÃ¬ Hiá»‡n táº¡i hoÃ n thÃ nh) -> approved." },
        { q: "42. The new policy will be highly (benefit) _____ to local businesses. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "beneficial", e: "Sau tráº¡ng tá»« 'highly' cáº§n TÃ­nh tá»« -> beneficial (cÃ³ lá»£i)." },
