        { q: "44. Please keep your personal belongings (secure) _____ at all times. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "secure", e: "Cáº¥u trÃºc: keep + Object + Adj (giá»¯ cho cÃ¡i gÃ¬ nhÆ° tháº¿ nÃ o) -> secure (an toÃ n)." },
        { q: "45. The machine requires regular (maintain) _____ to function properly. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "maintenance", e: "Sau tÃ­nh tá»« 'regular' cáº§n Danh tá»« -> maintenance (sá»± báº£o trÃ¬)." },
        { q: "46. They have made a (signify) _____ contribution to the project. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "significant", e: "Äá»©ng trÆ°á»›c danh tá»« 'contribution' cáº§n TÃ­nh tá»« -> significant (Ä‘Ã¡ng ká»ƒ)." },
        { q: "47. The manager evaluated the (perform) _____ of the staff. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "performance", e: "Sau máº¡o tá»« 'the' cáº§n Danh tá»« -> performance (hiá»‡u suáº¥t, pháº§n thá»ƒ hiá»‡n)." },
        { q: "48. You need written (permit) _____ to enter this restricted area. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "permission", e: "Sau tÃ­nh tá»« 'written' (Ä‘Æ°á»£c viáº¿t/báº±ng vÄƒn báº£n) cáº§n Danh tá»« -> permission (sá»± cho phÃ©p)." },
        { q: "49. (Strategy) _____, the company decided to expand into Asia. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "strategically", e: "Äá»©ng Ä‘áº§u cÃ¢u vÃ  cÃ³ dáº¥u pháº©y, cáº§n Tráº¡ng tá»« bá»• nghÄ©a cho cáº£ cÃ¢u -> Strategically (Vá» máº·t chiáº¿n lÆ°á»£c)." },
        { q: "50. To (strong) _____ your password, add numbers and symbols. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "strengthen", e: "Sau 'To' chá»‰ má»¥c Ä‘Ã­ch cáº§n Äá»™ng tá»« nguyÃªn thá»ƒ -> strengthen (tÄƒng cÆ°á»ng)." },
        { q: "51. The factory's daily (produce) _____ has increased by 20%. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "production", e: "Chá»§ ngá»¯ cá»§a cÃ¢u, Ä‘á»©ng sau tÃ­nh tá»« 'daily' cáº§n Danh tá»« -> production (sáº£n lÆ°á»£ng/sá»± sáº£n xuáº¥t)." },
        { q: "52. She is entirely (depend) _____ on her parents for financial support. [NÃ¢ng cao]", a: "dependent", e: "Sau to be 'is' vÃ  tráº¡ng tá»« 'entirely', káº¿t há»£p giá»›i tá»« 'on' -> TÃ­nh tá»« dependent (phá»¥ thuá»™c)." },
